                                "sense_id": "6d5ac9f3-eedd-3c97-8d8b-bcea4320d703",
                                "text": "And, for those simple times, his garments were / A chieftain-king's: beneath his breast, half bare, / Was hung a silver bugle, and between / His nervy knees there lay a boar-spear keen […]"
